Ledgerly (repository: tally-oss)
A local-first desktop accounting app for Indian small businesses.

This project is independent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Tally
Solutions Pvt. Ltd. "Tally" and "TallyPrime" are trademarks of their owner; they are used here
only to name the file formats Ledgerly reads for compatibility.

Ledgerly is a clean-room implementation: its behaviour is modelled on public documentation,
cited in the code and tests. It contains no code, artwork or design taken from that product.

